sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as MLflow SDK Client
    participant Gateway as ODH Gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant MLflow as MLflow Server<br/>5000/TCP HTTP/HTTPS
    participant KubeAuth as kubernetes-auth<br/>Plugin
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant DB as PostgreSQL<br/>5432/TCP TLS
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS

    Note over Client,S3: Flow 1: SDK Client — Experiment Tracking

    Client->>Gateway: POST /mlflow/api/2.0/mlflow/runs/create<br/>Auth: Bearer Token<br/>Header: X-MLFLOW-WORKSPACE: my-namespace
    Gateway->>MLflow: Forward request<br/>5000/TCP
    MLflow->>KubeAuth: Authenticate & authorize
    KubeAuth->>K8sAPI: SelfSubjectAccessReview<br/>Group: mlflow.kubeflow.org<br/>Resource: experiments<br/>Namespace: my-namespace
    K8sAPI-->>KubeAuth: allowed: true
    KubeAuth-->>MLflow: Request authorized
    MLflow->>DB: INSERT INTO runs<br/>WHERE workspace = 'my-namespace'
    DB-->>MLflow: Run created
    MLflow-->>Gateway: 200 OK + Run ID
    Gateway-->>Client: JSON Response

    Note over Client,S3: Flow 1 (continued): Artifact Upload

    Client->>Gateway: PUT /mlflow/api/2.0/mlflow-artifacts/artifacts/model.pkl<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    Gateway->>MLflow: Forward request<br/>5000/TCP
    MLflow->>KubeAuth: Authenticate & authorize
    KubeAuth->>K8sAPI: SelfSubjectAccessReview
    K8sAPI-->>KubeAuth: allowed: true
    MLflow->>S3: PutObject (model.pkl)<br/>Auth: AWS SigV4
    S3-->>MLflow: Upload complete
    MLflow-->>Gateway: 200 OK
    Gateway-->>Client: Success

    Note over Client,S3: Flow 2: UI Dashboard Access

    participant Browser as Browser

    Browser->>Gateway: GET /mlflow/<br/>Auth: OAuth (via ODH Dashboard)
    Gateway->>MLflow: Forward with Bearer token
    MLflow->>KubeAuth: Authenticate
    KubeAuth->>K8sAPI: SelfSubjectAccessReview
    K8sAPI-->>KubeAuth: allowed: true
    MLflow->>DB: SELECT experiments, runs<br/>WHERE workspace = scope
    DB-->>MLflow: Results
    MLflow-->>Gateway: HTML + React App
    Gateway-->>Browser: Dashboard UI
